## \uc0\u55356 \u57263  ADK Architecture Overview\
\
### Why Google ADK for WhatsApp AI?\
\
Google ADK provides:\
- **Workflow Agents**: Deterministic control flow (Sequential, Parallel, Loop)\
- **Tool Confirmation**: Human-in-the-loop for sensitive operations (escalations, broadcasts)\
- **Multi-Model Support**: Use Gemini 2.5 Flash for speed, Pro for complex reasoning\
- **State Management**: Pass context between agents seamlessly\
- **LiteLLM Integration**: Can use Claude via LiteLLM if needed\
\
### Architecture Pattern\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\fs24 \cf0 Customer Message \uc0\u8594  WhatsApp Webhook \u8594  ADK Runner \u8595  [Main Orchestrator Agent] \u8595  \u9484 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9532 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9488  \u8595  \u8595  \u8595  [Intent Classifier] [Context Gatherer] [Response Generator] (Flash Agent) (Parallel Agent) (Pro/Claude Agent) \u8595  \u8595  \u8595  Intent Type [File Search Tool] Natural Language Response [Product Lookup Tool] [FAQ Lookup Tool] \u8595  [Decision Agent] \u8595  High Confidence? / \u8232 Yes No \u8595  \u8595  Send to Customer [Escalation Agent] (Tool Confirmation) \u8595  Notify Owner + Hold Message
