\f1\b\fs28 \cf0 4. Confidence Scorer Agent\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f2\b0\fs26 \cf0 confidence_scorer = LlmAgent(\
    model="gemini-2.5-flash",\
    name="ConfidenceScorer",\
    description="Evaluate confidence in AI response",\
    instruction="""Evaluate the AI's response quality and confidence.\
\
AI Response: \{ai_response\}\
\
Criteria for HIGH confidence (score 0.9-1.0):\
